SUMMARY:📽️PSYNEMA festive: Last Christmas at Okūma
DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://luma.com/65x5ogri\n\nAd
 dress:\nOkūma - Tea House & Social Club\nBudapest, Hungary\n\n✨A privat
 e screening, a grounding tea ceremony and a psychologist-led conversation,
  in one of Budapest’s most beautiful hidden tea houses.✨\nChristmas is
  meant to be the most wonderful time of the year. Yet so many of us feel a
  little out of place in this season…\nMaybe you live between two countri
 es and neither quite feels like home. Maybe you’ve moved back, only to f
 ind that home has moved on without you. Or maybe you’re looking at the l
 ife you have and wondering when exactly you were supposed to have it all f
 igured out.\nThis December, PSYNEMA, where film meets psychology, comes to
  Budapest…\n\nHosted by Zsófia Nyul & Anna Boldog
LOCATION:Okūma - Tea House & Social Club, Budapest, Vörösmarty u. 19, 1
 074 Hungary
GEO:47.5049212;19.069343
SEQUENCE:217607684
STATUS:TENTATIVE
